# Not read by any code yet — src/App.jsx is still fully self-contained mock
# state (see backend/README.md and the note in DEPLOYMENT.md). This exists
# so the variable name is already decided and documented for when the app
# gets wired to the real backend (fetch calls to /api/auth, /api/contact-requests,
# /api/bum-sessions, etc. — see backend/src/routes/ for the actual endpoints).
#
# Set this in Vercel's dashboard (Project Settings → Environment Variables)
# once wiring begins — Vite only exposes vars prefixed VITE_ to client code.
VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://your-backend-url.com/api"
